evo2-neuron-decode
Evo 2 (StripedHyena 2) autoregressive decode on AWS Trainium 2 with PyTorch Native (TorchNeuron).

This package is distributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (LICENSE).

It contains no third-party source code. At runtime it patches methods of the upstream model
definition, which is NOT included and must be obtained separately:
  Zymrael/vortex (https://github.com/Zymrael/vortex), Apache License 2.0
  ArcInstitute/evo2 configs (https://github.com/ArcInstitute/evo2), Apache License 2.0
It calls the AWS Neuron NKI Library (nkilib, Apache License 2.0), shipped with the Neuron SDK.
Model weights (arcinstitute/evo2_7b_base on Hugging Face) are downloaded separately under their own license.
